<title>FRANCE: Sri Lanka bought 50,000 tonnes wheat - traders.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka bought 50,000 tonnes wheat - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka has bought 50,000 tonnes of optional-origin soft wheat at around $162 per tonne including freight, European grain exporters said on Monday.</p>
<p>The purchase, carried out last week, is for wheat of any origin but the grain could be supplied from Britain, they said.</p>
<p>Shipment is due from February.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
